<article class="env-remark" id="DA2836">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/DA2836">Remark <span data-tag="DA2836">4.1.2.9</span>.</a> Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix { X' \ar [d] \ar [r]^{f'} &amp;  X \ar [d]^{p} \\ S' \ar [r]^{f} &amp;  S } \]
</div>
  <p> be a pullback diagram of simplicial sets. Suppose that $p$ is smooth and that $f$ is cofinal. Then $f'$ is cofinal: this follows immediately from characterization $(2)$ of Proposition <a href="/tag/876ECD" data-tag="876ECD">4.1.2.7</a> and characterization $(3)$ of Proposition <a href="/tag/43E46F" data-tag="43E46F">4.1.2.5</a>. </p>
